portable-os-admin (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial packaging: installs the admin TUI plus its Python
    dependencies (into a private virtualenv, since Debian's own
    python3-textual is far too old for this project) and pulls in
    parted, cryptsetup, debootstrap as system dependencies.

